# WordPress public site (eludein.art)

- Work only in `wordpress/themes/eludein-child/`.
- Never copy or edit `wp-admin`, `wp-includes`, `wp-config.php`, or WooCommerce plugin files.
- Do not add `woocommerce/` PHP templates in the child theme unless explicitly requested: cart, checkout, and account must keep WooCommerce markup.
- Visual changes go in `assets/css/`. Preserve Fleur `#fleur-container` / `#fleur-duo-container` rules in `legacy-custom.css`.
- Deploy via `python scripts/wp_theme_pack.py` (WP Admin zip) or `python scripts/wp_theme_sync.py` (FTP child-theme folder only).
- Site is Hostinger hPanel, not the Coolify VPS. Doc: `docs/WORDPRESS-THEME.md`.
